---
alwaysApply: true
description: >-
  Prevent consumer-specific spill into related libraries, git submodules, and
  nested repositories. Apply when creating or editing files under providers/,
  packs, vendored trees, or any path that resolves to another git repo.
  Triggers: submodule, related library, nested repository, portable module,
